# Plan It / Student Spending Analytics does not read any environment variables.
#
# Paths are resolved by src/student_spending/config.py: an editable checkout uses
# the repository root, and an installed wheel uses the current working directory.
# Database, report, upload and log locations are CLI options or module constants.
#
# This file exists so a deployment checklist can show that no secret is required.
# Do not put real student data, card numbers, bank details, mobile-money PINs,
# national ID numbers or payment credentials in this project or in this file.
#
# Nothing here is loaded at runtime. Adding a variable below would have no effect
# until the code reads it deliberately and the tests cover it.
